{
  "native_artifact_sha256": "4de9a0d8afd54336958ca0e8072cd598f5f744c4e099c2110af8637c2d975c95",
  "sdk_segments": [
    {
      "text": "Um, after—",
      "start_ms": 660,
      "end_ms": 1620,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 0,
      "token_end_index": 4
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's an option too, yeah, after dinner.",
      "start_ms": 1680,
      "end_ms": 3960,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 4,
      "token_end_index": 19
    },
    {
      "text": " Deal.",
      "start_ms": 4080,
      "end_ms": 5220,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 19,
      "token_end_index": 21
    },
    {
      "text": " Sure.",
      "start_ms": 5340,
      "end_ms": 5640,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 21,
      "token_end_index": 24
    },
    {
      "text": " Three is good, though. But yeah, whatever. What would you prefer?",
      "start_ms": 6060,
      "end_ms": 10080,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 24,
      "token_end_index": 48
    },
    {
      "text": " Or 3:30. I just— yeah.",
      "start_ms": 10200,
      "end_ms": 12960,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 48,
      "token_end_index": 59
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it doesn't matter for me, I mean—",
      "start_ms": 13440,
      "end_ms": 14760,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 59,
      "token_end_index": 74
    },
    {
      "text": " Not necessarily.",
      "start_ms": 14760,
      "end_ms": 15180,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 74,
      "token_end_index": 80
    },
    {
      "text": " 3:30 in the computer room in here, and then we can just go—",
      "start_ms": 15420,
      "end_ms": 18120,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 80,
      "token_end_index": 100
    },
    {
      "text": " Just get in there, though.",
      "start_ms": 18120,
      "end_ms": 19020,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 100,
      "token_end_index": 109
    },
    {
      "text": " If you can't— can you get in the front door?",
      "start_ms": 19260,
      "end_ms": 21060,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 109,
      "token_end_index": 125
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 21120,
      "end_ms": 21300,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 125,
      "token_end_index": 127
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, you haven't got a key, do you? Can none of you get in there?",
      "start_ms": 21360,
      "end_ms": 23760,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 127,
      "token_end_index": 152
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, we can get in through the—",
      "start_ms": 23880,
      "end_ms": 25020,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 152,
      "token_end_index": 161
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, front door.",
      "start_ms": 25020,
      "end_ms": 25380,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 161,
      "token_end_index": 166
    },
    {
      "text": " Through the—",
      "start_ms": 25380,
      "end_ms": 25800,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 166,
      "token_end_index": 170
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer room's in here, the MSC computer lobby.",
      "start_ms": 25980,
      "end_ms": 28980,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 170,
      "token_end_index": 188
    },
    {
      "text": " I've not found that yet.",
      "start_ms": 28980,
      "end_ms": 29700,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 188,
      "token_end_index": 196
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh, it's in here.",
      "start_ms": 29820,
      "end_ms": 30300,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 196,
      "token_end_index": 203
    },
    {
      "text": " How about if we take a—",
      "start_ms": 30300,
      "end_ms": 31020,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 203,
      "token_end_index": 211
    },
    {
      "text": " Or if you find me, I'll show you where— I'll let us all in there, we can all go in there.",
      "start_ms": 31020,
      "end_ms": 35160,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 211,
      "token_end_index": 244
    },
    {
      "text": " We can look now, afterwards.",
      "start_ms": 35340,
      "end_ms": 36780,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 244,
      "token_end_index": 253
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, yeah, exactly. You do need to have a key for it, though, that's the thing. It's got a locked door, but—",
      "start_ms": 37200,
      "end_ms": 40860,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 253,
      "token_end_index": 292
    },
    {
      "text": " Just bang on it.",
      "start_ms": 41040,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 292,
      "token_end_index": 297
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, somebody'll answer.",
      "start_ms": 42240,
      "end_ms": 43020,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 297,
      "token_end_index": 307
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, I was asking Steve about that, whether we can get in there. Whether he was going to get us access into there.",
      "start_ms": 43020,
      "end_ms": 47760,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 307,
      "token_end_index": 344
    },
    {
      "text": " Into what?",
      "start_ms": 48180,
      "end_ms": 48660,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 344,
      "token_end_index": 349
    },
    {
      "text": " The computer room.",
      "start_ms": 48780,
      "end_ms": 49320,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 349,
      "token_end_index": 354
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay. Yeah. It's only got— it's crap, it's only got about 4 or 5 computers in, but it would do quite good for our job, because it can also— it's not very abnormally many people in it very often.",
      "start_ms": 49560,
      "end_ms": 57900,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 354,
      "token_end_index": 420
    },
    {
      "text": " Right. Is there a printer in there too?",
      "start_ms": 58140,
      "end_ms": 59760,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 420,
      "token_end_index": 433
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, there's a printer in there. And there's a photocopier. With the code on it, yeah, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 59820,
      "end_ms": 63900,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 433,
      "token_end_index": 465
    },
    {
      "text": " That's cool, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 64860,
      "end_ms": 65580,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 465,
      "token_end_index": 471
    },
    {
      "text": " Huh.",
      "start_ms": 66780,
      "end_ms": 67080,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 471,
      "token_end_index": 474
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, and the photocopier. I've heard of it.",
      "start_ms": 67860,
      "end_ms": 69900,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 474,
      "token_end_index": 492
    },
    {
      "text": " Assignment.",
      "start_ms": 70020,
      "end_ms": 70440,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 492,
      "token_end_index": 496
    },
    {
      "text": " If we want to.",
      "start_ms": 70920,
      "end_ms": 72060,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 496,
      "token_end_index": 503
    },
    {
      "text": " We've got it in my computer.",
      "start_ms": 72660,
      "end_ms": 73740,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 503,
      "token_end_index": 513
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 74100,
      "end_ms": 74220,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 513,
      "token_end_index": 515
    },
    {
      "text": " Whatever comments I'm thinking.",
      "start_ms": 74340,
      "end_ms": 75540,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 515,
      "token_end_index": 526
    },
    {
      "text": " So what time do we say?",
      "start_ms": 76080,
      "end_ms": 77820,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 526,
      "token_end_index": 534
    },
    {
      "text": " I just think it's better to do it afterwards than we have all the time we need.",
      "start_ms": 78120,
      "end_ms": 80820,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 534,
      "token_end_index": 557
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, that's true.",
      "start_ms": 80880,
      "end_ms": 81300,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 557,
      "token_end_index": 564
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, then have half an hour and then we'll—",
      "start_ms": 81660,
      "end_ms": 83160,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 564,
      "token_end_index": 579
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, yeah.",
      "start_ms": 83280,
      "end_ms": 83580,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 579,
      "token_end_index": 583
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually run out.",
      "start_ms": 83580,
      "end_ms": 84240,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 583,
      "token_end_index": 589
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 84480,
      "end_ms": 84660,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 589,
      "token_end_index": 591
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah.",
      "start_ms": 85380,
      "end_ms": 85560,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 591,
      "token_end_index": 593
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay. As long as DNLG doesn't go late.",
      "start_ms": 87300,
      "end_ms": 90420,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 593,
      "token_end_index": 608
    },
    {
      "text": " Hopefully it's not that man, so it won't matter.",
      "start_ms": 91800,
      "end_ms": 93480,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 608,
      "token_end_index": 625
    },
    {
      "text": " Actually, it's not even confirmed yet.",
      "start_ms": 96300,
      "end_ms": 97920,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 625,
      "token_end_index": 638
    },
    {
      "text": " What?",
      "start_ms": 98760,
      "end_ms": 99000,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 638,
      "token_end_index": 641
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 99180,
      "end_ms": 99360,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 641,
      "token_end_index": 643
    },
    {
      "text": " She doesn't even know what she's talking about yet. Maybe it doesn't happen at all.",
      "start_ms": 99660,
      "end_ms": 104100,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 643,
      "token_end_index": 672
    },
    {
      "text": " Yeah, I know.",
      "start_ms": 104880,
      "end_ms": 105360,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 672,
      "token_end_index": 678
    },
    {
      "text": " Sounds like me.",
      "start_ms": 105360,
      "end_ms": 105840,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 678,
      "token_end_index": 684
    },
    {
      "text": " It's reading week next week. It should be. It should be.",
      "start_ms": 105900,
      "end_ms": 107820,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 684,
      "token_end_index": 705
    },
    {
      "text": " Is it reading?",
      "start_ms": 107820,
      "end_ms": 108960,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 705,
      "token_end_index": 711
    },
    {
      "text": " Well, it's supposed to be.",
      "start_ms": 109140,
      "end_ms": 110160,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 711,
      "token_end_index": 721
    },
    {
      "text": " Okay.",
      "start_ms": 110460,
      "end_ms": 110640,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 721,
      "token_end_index": 723
    },
    {
      "text": " Next week. It's week 6 next week.",
      "start_ms": 111240,
      "end_ms": 113160,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 723,
      "token_end_index": 736
    },
    {
      "text": " Reading.",
      "start_ms": 113280,
      "end_ms": 113880,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 736,
      "token_end_index": 738
    },
    {
      "text": " Oh.",
      "start_ms": 113940,
      "end_ms": 114060,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 738,
      "token_end_index": 740
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't think we have a reading week, though.",
      "start_ms": 114120,
      "end_ms": 115500,
      "speaker": "1",
      "token_start_index": 740,
      "token_end_index": 756
    },
    {
      "text": " I don't know. We have one class, at least, when we, like, speech perception, we don't have any lectures. ",
      "start_ms": 115620,
      "end_ms": 119640,
      "speaker": "2",
      "token_start_index": 756,
      "token_end_index": 791
    }
  ],
